---
/**
 * brand/logo/wordmark-header-static.svg (literal #1d1d1f letters, #0071e3 dot; brand USAGE) as a same-origin, content-hashed <img> (Vite ?url → /_astro/…,
 * immutable cache). Inlined it cost ≈1.3 KiB br on every page (SHELL-2 measurement); as an image it
 * is fetched once and cached across pages. It is never the LCP element (217×18 px) and never preloaded.
 * Decorative (alt=""): the enclosing link carries chrome.homeLink. Height 14px at 360, 18px from
 * 768 (brand USAGE). Owner: shell.
 */
import src from '../../../../../brand/logo/wordmark-header-static.svg?url';
---
<img class="wm" src={src} alt="" width="217" height="18" decoding="async" />

<style is:global>
  @layer components {
    .wm { inline-size: 168px; block-size: 14px; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .wm { inline-size: 217px; block-size: 18px; } }
  }
</style>
